                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Having two mctp_pktbuf_free()s here makes it harder to read than I think is necessary. How about this if we want to free the packet regardless:\n\n bool eom = false;\n while ((pkt = bus->tx_queue_head) && !eom) {\n  eom = mctp_pktbuf_hdr(pkt)->flags_seq_tag & MCTP_HDR_FLAG_EOM;\n  bus->tx_queue_head = pkt->next;\n  mctp_pktbuf_free(pkt);\n }"
